text = "As you explore the museum, you'll come to one of our touchscreens. There you can make a selection of one of the Spirit Guides we have in our museum. These Spirit Guides represent real historical figures, that lived in this area of Texas in the 1800s.

The Spirit Guides have different topics to share. Select one on the touchscreen, and they will appear as a life-size high-definition hologram.

Use this app to have a transcript and translation of the stories our Spirit Guides share!"
